# Working papers are committed on purpose: the plans, the audits and the reviews
# show where the project is going, and a reader who lands on the repository can
# follow the argument. They stay off the published site: `packages/docs/_collect.mjs`
# excludes them, so the repository grows and the site keeps only the chapters.
